{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0113_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e19185a1e1b1f6c0960d8c33a5bc8d8ea6be04665bdd63687ec00762bd337205", "ja": "育、ひな祭りライブお疲れさま。\n頑張ったご褒美だ、今日は何でも注文していいぞ！", "zh": "育，女儿节演唱会辛苦你了。\n你今天要吃什么都可以，就当成奖赏你的努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0113_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "ed4abc3a921dc20d6a4e12c43ed109edf6fdcb8e7a248892d70d1ae8a216e298", "ja": "やったー！　ねぇねぇ{$P$}さん、\n今日のわたし、どうだった？", "zh": "万岁──！欸欸，{$P$}先生，\n你觉得今天的我怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0113_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5673e2cb3e6feea3699a24b4276fa038538140e6d7b5a49338b832da984246fd", "ja": "ライブの感想か？　もちろん今日の育も、\nバッチリかわいかったぞ！", "zh": "你是问演唱会的感想吗？\n今天的育当然也可爱得无可挑剔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0113_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "06a6215928c6f7185d0ef52eecbed80e5591ec0e3e0574c4e41c1360469ac409", "ja": "ううん、かわいいじゃなくて！　今日のわたし、\nろっくで、セクシーじゃなかった？", "zh": "不是啦，我不是指可不可爱！\n今天的我是不是既摇滚又性感？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0113_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "7829b9e2ef20fd3cfdcac4c15052ea08dff209d9e66c093d74f868ff3ec5b6ee", "ja": "このみさんに教えてもらって、大人っぽくて\nセクシーなわたしを目指して、がんばったんだから♪", "zh": "我接受了木实姊姊的教导，\n很努力地让自己变得成熟又性感喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0113_1005_p", "source_sha256": "91f203d5a4e1204b50e8cf353bb9b193ee607f979fbf8a7e8329d881a29ea411", "ja": "そ、そうだな。ロックだったとは思うけど、\nセクシーはまだちょっと早いかな……？", "zh": "这、这个嘛，我是觉得你很摇滚，\n但要说性感还有点早吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0113_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "834c5efafb9818fbafb394aa85873f5d90849c37cc89d6307f9b1b9f326f06d6", "ja": "むぅ～……。{$P$}さん、\nそれって、わたしが子どもだから？", "zh": "唔……{$P$}先生，\n你是说，就因为我是小孩？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0113_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "3b630efb3d0635e9b495559d5e2aafe56a89a40cd25b8adb692db4256f559f67", "ja": "わたしだって、アイドルのお仕事いっぱいしてるよ？\nなのに、セクシーはダメなの？", "zh": "我都做了这么多偶像的工作，\n却不行变得性感吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0113_1008_p", "source_sha256": "80dd82b32a022f92bfc833f19253154a860dcaa9bc74c78a4b47cf79eca13f9b", "ja": "ダメというか……でもいつもより\n大人っぽかったから、それで十分じゃないか？", "zh": "与其说是不行……\n不过，你看起来确实比平常成熟，这样就够了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0113_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "a3b8694acac5d5a682ff90046b27c29f742d624fc84d25accae8ffb9ac5efeca", "ja": "えっ……それ、本当？\nわたし、ちゃんと大人っぽかった？", "zh": "咦……你是说真的？\n我真的看起来很成熟？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0113_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a19faad401353d6a6b274999daca3ea20adf61e9e559ff0c54e12465621c3b5f", "ja": "ああ。それに今日のライブが成功したのは、\n育が頑張ったからだよ。またひとつ、大人になったな。", "zh": "是啊，因为育努力过了，今天的演唱会才这么成功。\n你又朝大人迈进了一步呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0113_1011_p", "source_sha256": "db6f7496c8dce068c75a39d15d0417539ce5ffae54637145c57c2e8663004280", "ja": "だからこれからも、育らしく\nアイドルとして頑張っていこう！", "zh": "今后也保持你的本色，\n在偶像的路上努力下去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0113_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "22607c9db70ac941a6e0541d75bc5f6d76c98fd40b24ecf6e9715eedbec11833", "ja": "そっかぁ……うん、わかった！\nありがとう、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "这样啊……嗯，我懂了！\n谢谢你，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0113_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "9a5f586d3233cbadca8ebd043bbd852d66881e9293685d0c59a43bb528ca976c", "ja": "じゃあ今日は、食後のデザートはガマンするね。\nわたし、ひとつ大人になったし！", "zh": "那我今天就忍耐不吃饭后甜点了。\n毕竟我朝大人迈进了一步嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0113_1014_p", "source_sha256": "9d504c6a9ae3c77122f6436cbb5926b6d0b0913d99feba3c564035062fc4d9cb", "ja": "それは別に、我慢しなくてもいいんじゃないか？\n大人の女性だって、スイーツが好きな人は多いぞ！", "zh": "应该没必要忍耐吧？\n就算是成年女性，也有很多爱吃甜食的人喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0113_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "ba513cacfb0485d096da526271e115747d105a708f8eed4e902f9c447ffad7c9", "ja": "あっ……そうだね。\nじゃあやっぱり、食べる！", "zh": "啊……说得也是。\n那我还是要吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0113_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "268ccc9c0067ec4296d876c4a1c1dd651e40799551aa36b76acf046820549765", "ja": "すみませーん！\n注文、おねがいします♪", "zh": "不好意思──！\n我们想要点餐♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0113_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "9e6f8756b16ef9329650c01b5546fdebae74d427ca8374dbf19a93095f75cb65", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、何食べるの？　好き\n嫌いすると大きくなれないから、残すのはダメだよ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你要吃什么？\n挑食会长不大的，所以不能吃剩喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
